>through another few levels, finally find a key. Apply key to chest.
>"You don't see a door there." Hm... ok. Let's try #force. "You decide
>not to force the issue."

Apply chest to look in it. If it is locked, then you either need something
to unlock it, jimmy the lock, or pick the lock...or, you may need to take a
more #force -ful approach.

>3) I displaced my little dog. Did that hurt him at all? Did it do
>anything at all? Make it less tame? Anything?

The message just lets you know that you traded places with the pet. It
doesn't affect tameness or harm the pet at all.



